{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>52歲劉愷威自2018年與楊冪離婚後，曾與內地女星李曉峰相戀，這段戀情已於今年4月悄然告終。近來他被爆與32歲「第四代邦民女」黎紀君（Christy）譜出相差20年的「父女戀」，掀起網民熱議！兩人毫不避忌大方認愛，朋友聚會上出雙入對拍拖，互動親密！近來兩人又一齊與朋友在家中歎大閘蟹，胸貼頸合影勁恩愛！</p><figure><img alt=\"劉愷威與黎紀君近來經常一起打波。（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189162740577603584724158.jpeg/EPoTParRkOwbK0wu_zzRO_-_yrtNBgCihZSm84WUpvM\"/><figcaption>劉愷威與黎紀君近來經常一起打波。（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁諾妍與洪永城，與胡定欣及老公，以及劉愷威黎紀君打波。（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199428012815290368952760.png/0HzBizXaG3FIcqWmhyk_Lb0qS3g3bUIhwCjnkMAo55A\"/><figcaption>梁諾妍與洪永城，與胡定欣及老公，以及劉愷威黎紀君打波。（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure><p>黎紀君劉愷威「胸貼頸」歎大閘蟹</p><p>劉愷威和黎紀君自大方認愛後在不同場合都出雙入對。近日黎紀君和劉愷威到朋友家食大閘蟹，朋友相聚自然少不得拍下合照。穿上小背心的黎紀君抱住劉愷威，從後貼身環抱男朋友拍下合照。劉愷威被黎紀君抱在懷中，一臉冧到爆！雖然兩人相差20歲，但劉愷威外表凍齡，同黎紀君十分合襯。有網民指今次劉愷威拍拖常放閃，「可能人對了」；又有網民指劉愷威條件出色，「帥氣又多金的男人，怨不得黎紀君摟住不放手」。</p><figure><img alt=\"黎紀君（Christy）被稱為「第四代邦民女」。（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189170525985837056509617.jpeg/AC-HTC0yqofjwaDh2SbsyD0__VPziwdgz9hmic_YZok\"/><figcaption>黎紀君（Christy）被稱為「第四代邦民女」。（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><p>劉愷威早前被週刊爆出其與年輕20歲的「第四代邦民女」黎紀君秘密撻着。兩位當事人認愛並透露雙方因熱愛打匹克球（Pickleball）與網球而結緣，志趣相投。對於兒子有新戀情，爸爸劉丹亦大方「開綠燈」，坦言非常盼望能見這位「同聲同氣」的未來新抱。</p><figure><img alt=\"黎紀君劉愷威「胸貼頸」合照。（ 網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201677631838228480069532.png/zBN3L7Q2XxxlWsfCbC85_Tx7VE_LKazWjJiB3IyYgdw\"/><figcaption>黎紀君劉愷威「胸貼頸」合照。（ 網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民留言。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201678767932706816185734.jpeg/9v7vYh3KPtq_YoJUrnbZsk0uFr1Og6N9ilXJm4pVyZs\"/><figcaption>網民留言。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民留言。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201678765487296512709614.jpeg/rg0evtqasv2I9xiqoarjNcEe-Q-DqgPHnxvYBJ8b2AQ\"/><figcaption>網民留言。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黎紀君出動「絕對領域」。（Instagram/@christylaiii)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4008697/org/07570a416189874c70ff386c3262f3ac.jpg/96HtQTfSMbPoi6r0NNa-XtBOqwyOY3CUQ05p90NOafc\"/><figcaption>黎紀君出動「絕對領域」。（Instagram/@christylaiii)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黎紀君好靚！（Instagram：@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210425/463058634939699200367842.jpeg/Qpsc80I-YQZbOaEnYpz_EaUhxOv26gLuBp9j8wafY_M\"/><figcaption>黎紀君好靚！（Instagram：@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黎紀君好靚！（Instagram：@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210425/463058632603340800438912.jpeg/v19LWTnZ0jTsIedpHQUsLwi5OJolA7BRzNyEbszchG4\"/><figcaption>黎紀君好靚！（Instagram：@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黎紀君被封「第四代邦民女」。（Instagram：@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210425/463058637221531648712365.jpeg/lNiGsOSws58ZGkrPph9yUogNHSebPJTAevbeLnr23i4\"/><figcaption>黎紀君被封「第四代邦民女」。（Instagram：@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黎紀君被封「第四代邦民女」。（Instagram：@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210425/463058641273491456561274.jpeg/PhFzKI-MNLF-jF7whZ4bYiKyBWdUsIcmXURZNV1EWTU\"/><figcaption>黎紀君被封「第四代邦民女」。（Instagram：@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黎紀君身材外貌俱佳。（Instagram：@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210425/463058639398506496304891.jpeg/KsFfWm4jYeVbgwhVWrzzeJdQMGS_xSo_CT7B9gk-wfY\"/><figcaption>黎紀君身材外貌俱佳。（Instagram：@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黎紀君由主持跨界踏入大銀幕出演《夜王》。（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189198147318976512845320.jpeg/ds-eIDnbVJhQCGHHGJsHkIfaTRLwepdVzz0_3c89P90\"/><figcaption>黎紀君由主持跨界踏入大銀幕出演《夜王》。（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Christy黎紀君由主持跨界踏入大銀幕出演《夜王》！（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189195839407394816347591.jpeg/kMplqE_vqkCzSGydDeMUEtaWxxs8e3tL9fXXOvX11zo\"/><figcaption>Christy黎紀君由主持跨界踏入大銀幕出演《夜王》！（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T23:22:42.616186+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":944,"images":14,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T23:00:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T00:36:49.737486+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T23:16:13.056448+00:00","content_hash":"73af2ef3c44d6971d20903bc4daf80645f94ec675d1bf9dc9fb694c9dc2ef097","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}